  "body": "### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* **iterm2:** Fix a regression introduced in 1.1.6 where `trzsz-iterm2` hangs indefinitely during file uploads and downloads. The client now correctly starts the `TrzszIO` background stdin reader thread before awaiting transfer configurations, resolving the blocked pipe issue in the iTerm2 coprocess integration.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/trzsz/trzsz/compare/v1.1.6...v1.1.7"
